    "description": "Use whenever an agent step is a DECISION rather than writing — routing, triage, in scope or not, risky or not, severity, pass/fail, done or not, escalate or not, which model or lane, whether a finding is real. Also use when designing a gate, a verdict, a review outcome, a delegate's return contract, or a hook that allows or blocks. Makes the answer typed, atomic, independently judged, and gated on confidence that was measured rather than claimed.\n",
